    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a talented chocobo knight gains experience, he learns a number of talents that expand his role as a mounted combatant. Starting at 2nd, a talented chocobo knight gains a mounted talent. He gains an additional mounted talent at 4th level and every two chocobo knight levels thereafter (through 10th level). A chocobo knight cannot select an individual talent more than once unless the talent specifies otherwise.</p>",
